---
import Button from '@components/ui/Button.astro';
---

<section
	data-testid="reflection"
	id="reflection"
	class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center py-20 lg:py-32"
>
	<h2 class="mb-2 font-monospace text-2xl text-orange lg:text-4xl">Reflection</h2>
	<span class="mb-10 h-1 w-10 bg-orange"></span>

	<div class="mb-10 grid w-full gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-orange/20 bg-white p-6 shadow dark:bg-black">
			<p class="mb-3 font-bold text-orange">What worked</p>
			<p class="text-sm text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
				Grounding design decisions in a specific, counterintuitive research finding — conversational
				fit matters more than food preference — gave the team a clear north star. Every field label
				and feature choice could be evaluated against that principle.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-orange/20 bg-white p-6 shadow dark:bg-black">
			<p class="mb-3 font-bold text-orange">What we'd do differently</p>
			<p class="text-sm text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
				Our participant pool skewed toward Chinese international students, limiting generalizability.
				A more diverse sample would have surfaced different safety concerns, dining norms, and social
				dynamics. We'd also introduce quantitative usability metrics (SUS, task completion rates)
				earlier.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-orange/20 bg-white p-6 shadow dark:bg-black">
			<p class="mb-3 font-bold text-orange">What's next</p>
			<p class="text-sm text-black dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
				A matching algorithm surfacing compatible companions, verified profiles to address safety
				concerns, and an empty-state experience for newly created events with no joiners yet.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-6 rounded-2xl bg-orange/5 py-14 text-center dark:bg-orange/10">
		<p class="text-xl font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
			Ready to explore the full interactive prototype?
		</p>
		<a
			href="https://www.figma.com/proto/GHEjNtXC88rwqjANMyj82r/PalUp?node-id=628-2444&t=9MffpE68rPn1Mh8K-1"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener"
		>
			<Button style={'primary'} size={'lg'} name="View Prototype">View Interactive Prototype →</Button>
		</a>
	</div>
</section>
